024900*************************************************************
025000*                  MAIN  PROCESSING                         *
025100*       IF THIS IS A MULTI-FREIGHT BILL, DPOFREIGHT NEEDS   *
025200*   TO BE UPDATED WITH A REFERENCE BACK TO THE ORIGINAL     *
025300*   FREIGHT INFORMATION.  DISPLAY THE SCREEN AND ACCEPT     *
025400*   FREIGHT DATA IF THIS IS NOT A MULTI-FREIGHT BILL.  IN   *
025500*   EITHER CASE, UPDATE THE DATABASE AND WRITE TRANS-       *
025600*   ACTIONS 350, 352, AND 323.  THESE TRANSACTIONS MUST     *
025700*   BE WRITTEN IN THIS ORDER FOR IBM'S P7205 PROGRAM TO     *
025800*   HANDLE THEM PROPERLY.                                   *
025900*************************************************************
026000*************************************************************
026100 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING VIEW-COMAREA,
026200                          ALL-PO-RLSE,
026300                          MISCELLANEOUS-DATA,
026400                          PASS-FREIGHT-DATA,
026500                          LANGUAGE-PARMS,
                                NET-RAW-WEIGHT
      *---11/11/97 JSB, REMOVE THESE PARMS
      *                         ITEM-TABLE,
      *                         RAW-MATERIAL-GROUP,
      *                         ANY-MORE-ITEMS-FLAG,
      *                         RCVR-FLAG
                                ASN-RECEIVER.
026600
026700 FREIGHT-DISPLAY SECTION 04.
026800 00-SFREIGHT-MAIN.
           OPEN I-O  DPOFREIGHT-O
                     MPORCV-O
                     DISPLAY-FILE
                     MPLTINFO-O
                     KFRTERMS-O
                     DDAILYTC-O.
           OPEN INPUT DPORECD.
026900
027200     MOVE SPACES TO DDAILYTC-DATA.
           MOVE 1 TO DATE-MODE.
027300     CALL "TDATECK2" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA, LANGUAGE-PARMS.
027400     MOVE DATE-YMD-OUT TO DDAILYTC-DATE.
027500     MOVE DATE-UNFORMATTED-TIME-OUT TO DDAILYTC-TIME.
027600
           MOVE "P" TO PO-INDIC, FRT-INDIC.
           MOVE "PO " TO PRIOR-PO-LITERAL.
           MOVE "PSQR" TO MPLTINFO-ARG.
           MOVE ZERO TO LANG-SETNUM, LANG-MSGNUM, FIELD-NUMBER.

           MOVE ZEROS TO WT-SCREEN-IDX.
           MOVE SPACES TO WEIGHT-SCREEN-BUFFER.
           INITIALIZE FREIGHT-SCREEN-BUFFER.

027800     PERFORM 100-CHECK-FOR-MULTI-FREIGHT THRU 109-EXIT.
027900
028000     IF NO-PRIOR-FREIGHT
028200        PERFORM 200-DISPLAY-SCREEN THRU 299-EXIT
028300        IF SAVE-F8-EXIT-SW = "Y"
