                   MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
031500
031800     IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
031900         IF COND-WORD = 17
032000             GO TO 109-EXIT
032100         ELSE
