039322     MOVE ZEROES TO WS-PO-RCVR.
039323     MOVE MISC-RS-ARG TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2).
039330*----------  RETRIEVE PO RECORD
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE MISC-RS-ARG    TO PORCVNO    OF DPORECD-REC.
           START DPORECD KEY = PORCVNO OF DPORECD-REC
               INVALID KEY MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                   MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
039333     IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
039334           MOVE "DBFIND DPORECD 200 SFREIGHT " TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
039335           MOVE WS-ACCUMULATOR              TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
039336           PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ DPORECD NEXT INTO BUF-DPORECD
               AT END MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
           IF PORCVNO OF DPORECD-REC NOT = MISC-RS-ARG
               MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
039339     IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
039340           MOVE "DBGET DPORECD 200 SFREIGHT  " TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
039341           MOVE WS-ACCUMULATOR              TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
039342           PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
039343
039344     MOVE PO-FREIGHT-TERMS TO TYPE-FREIGHT-BUF, SAVE-PO-TERM.
      *-------- INTERNAL ORDERS CAN ONLY BE PREPAID.   7/22/97
           IF SAVE-INTERNAL-FLAG = "X"
              MOVE "P"                           TO TYPE-FREIGHT-BUF.

      *----4/30/97, IF ASN RECEIPT RETRIEVE FRT DATA TO DISPLAY
           IF ASN-RECEIVER NOT = SPACES
               MOVE ASN-RECEIVER TO PORCVNO OF DPOFREIGHT-REC
               READ DPOFREIGHT-O INTO BUF-DPOFREIGHT
                 INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
               END-READ
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "READ DFREIGHT ASN 200" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   MOVE ASN-RECEIVER TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD(1)
                   PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT
               END-IF
               MOVE FRT-TYPE TO TYPE-FREIGHT-BUF
               MOVE FRT-EMPL TO EMPLOYEE-BUF
               MOVE FRT-PACK-SLIP TO P-SLIP-NO-BUF
               MOVE FRT-CARRIER TO CARRIER-BUF
               MOVE FRT-CARRIER-WT TO CARR-WT-BUF
               MOVE FRT-SEALS TO SEALS-BUF
               MOVE FRT-BILL-NO TO FREIGHT-NO-BUF
               MOVE FRT-RAIL-CAR TO CAR-NO-BUF
               MOVE FRT-YY TO YY-BUF
               MOVE FRT-MM TO MM-BUF
               MOVE FRT-DD TO DD-BUF
           END-IF.

039910 210-SHOW-FORM.
