       217-WEIGHT.
      * CHECK RAW MATERIAL WEIGHT AGAINST CARRIER'S WEIGHT.
      *   THIS IS ONLY DONE ON INVOICELESS PO'S.
           IF PO-INVOICELESS-IND NOT = "X"
               GO TO 220-MOVE-DATA.
           PERFORM 230-CHECK-RAW-WT THRU 230-CRW-EXIT.
           IF SAVE-F8-EXIT-SW = "Y"
               GO TO 299-EXIT.
