       230-CHECK-RAW-WT.
      *--11/11/97 JSB, REMOVE THIS LOGIC, NET WEIGHT PASSED AS PARM
      *    MOVE 2 TO PO-IDX.
      *    MOVE "N" TO MULTI-PO-SW.
      *----IF MULTI PO'S ON THIS FREIGHT, DO NOT CHECK WEIGHT
      *    PERFORM
      *        UNTIL PO-IDX > 7 OR MULTI-PO-SW = "Y"
      *      IF DE-PO(PO-IDX) NOT = SPACES
      *          MOVE "Y" TO MULTI-PO-SW
      *      ELSE
      *          ADD 1 TO PO-IDX
      *      END-IF
      *    END-PERFORM.
      *    IF MULTI-PO-SW = "Y"
      *        GO TO 230-CRW-EXIT.
      *----FOR EACH ITEM, IF ITS UM=LB AND IT IS IDENTIFIED AS A
      *----  A RAW MATERIAL IN THE PLANT THEN ADD ITS QTY RCVED
      *----  TO THE TOTAL WEIGHT RCVED.
      *    MOVE 1 TO ITEM-IDX.
      *230-CHECK-ITEM.
      *    IF ITEM-IDX > 13
      *        GO TO 230-CHECK-ITEM-END.
      *    IF SD-CODE(ITEM-IDX) = SPACES
      *        ADD 1 TO ITEM-IDX
      *        GO TO 230-CHECK-ITEM.
      *    IF NOT KELLY-PLANT
      *        IF SD-UM(ITEM-IDX) NOT = "LB"
      *            ADD 1 TO ITEM-IDX
      *            GO TO 230-CHECK-ITEM
      *        END-IF
      *    ELSE
      *        IF SD-KELLY-PO-UM(ITEM-IDX) NOT = "LB"
      *            ADD 1 TO ITEM-IDX
      *            GO TO 230-CHECK-ITEM
      *        END-IF
      *    END-IF.
      *    MOVE 1 TO RAW-IDX.
      *    MOVE "N" TO RAW-SW.
      *    PERFORM
      *      UNTIL RAW-IDX > 6 OR RAW-SW = "Y"
      *        IF SD-MAJOR-GROUP(ITEM-IDX) = RM-GROUP(RAW-IDX)
      *            MOVE "Y" TO RAW-SW
      *        ELSE
      *            ADD 1 TO RAW-IDX
      *        END-IF
      *    END-PERFORM.
      *    IF RAW-SW = "Y"
      *        ADD 1 TO WT-SCREEN-IDX
      *        MOVE SD-ITM(ITEM-IDX) TO WEIGHT-ITEM-BUF(WT-SCREEN-IDX)
      *        MOVE SD-CODE(ITEM-IDX) TO WEIGHT-CODE-BUF(WT-SCREEN-IDX)
      *        MOVE SD-PO-QTY-DLVR(ITEM-IDX) TO
      *                                  WEIGHT-QTY-BUF(WT-SCREEN-IDX)
      *        ADD  SD-PO-QTY-DLVR(ITEM-IDX) TO NET-RAW-WEIGHT
      *        IF NOT KELLY-PLANT
      *            MOVE SD-UM(ITEM-IDX) TO WEIGHT-UM-BUF(WT-SCREEN-IDX)
      *        ELSE
      *            MOVE SD-KELLY-PO-UM(ITEM-IDX) TO
      *                                    WEIGHT-UM-BUF(WT-SCREEN-IDX)
      *        END-IF
      *    END-IF.
      *    ADD 1 TO ITEM-IDX.
      *    GO TO 230-CHECK-ITEM.
      *230-CHECK-ITEM-END.
           IF NET-RAW-WEIGHT > CARR-WT-BUF
               MOVE NET-RAW-WEIGHT TO WEIGHT-RCVD-BUF
               MOVE CARR-WT-BUF TO WEIGHT-OF-FRT-BUF
               PERFORM 231-RAW-WT-WARNING THRU 231-RWW-EXIT.
       230-CRW-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       231-RAW-WT-WARNING.
           MOVE WT-SCREEN TO VIEW-NFNAME.
           MOVE WEIGHT-SCREEN-BUFFER TO DISPLAY-REC.
           WRITE DISPLAY-REC FORMAT IS VIEW-NFNAME
               INDIC ARE SRF-INDICATORS.
           MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS.
           READ DISPLAY-FILE FORMAT IS VIEW-NFNAME
               INDIC ARE SRF-INDICATORS.
           ACCEPT IOFEEDBACK FROM I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
           MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS.
           IF DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 3 TO VIEW-LASTKEY
           ELSE
               MOVE FUNCTION-NUM TO VIEW-LASTKEY.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3 OR VIEW-LASTKEY = 7
               MOVE "Y" TO SAVE-F8-EXIT-SW.
       231-RWW-EXIT.
           EXIT.


