       322-ADD-MULTI-ITEMS.
      *--11/11/97 JSB, NO LONGER NEEDED NO MORE REFERBACK FOR > 12 ITEMS
      *    IF NOT ANY-MORE-ITEMS
      *        GO TO 325-UNLOCK-FREIGHT.
      *----CHECK FOR REFERBACK TO A REFERBACK
      *    MOVE PO-RLSE-RS TO FRT-ARG.
      *    MOVE FRT-ARG TO PORCVNO OF DPOFREIGHT-REC.
      *    START DPOFREIGHT-O KEY = PORCVNO OF DPOFREIGHT-REC
      *        INVALID KEY MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
      *    IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
      *        IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
      *            MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
      *        ELSE
      *            MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
      *    IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
      *          MOVE "DBFIND DFREIGHT- 322 SFREIGHT" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
      *          MOVE PO-RLSE-RS TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
      *          MOVE FILE-STATUS TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3)
      *          PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
      *    MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
      *    READ DPOFREIGHT-O NEXT INTO BUF-DPOFREIGHT
      *        AT END MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
      *    IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
      *        IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
      *            MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD
      *        ELSE
      *            MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
      *    IF PORCVNO OF DPOFREIGHT-REC NOT = FRT-ARG
      *        MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
      *    IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
      *          MOVE "DBGET DFREIGHT -322 SFREIGHT" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
      *          MOVE PO-RLSE-RS TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
      *          MOVE FILE-STATUS TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3)
      *          PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
      *    IF FRT-REFERBACK NOT = SPACES
      *        MOVE FRT-REFERBACK TO REFERBACK-REFERBACK
      *    ELSE
      *        MOVE SPACES TO REFERBACK-REFERBACK.
      *
      *    MOVE SPACES                     TO  BUF-DPOFREIGHT.
      *    MOVE DE-PO (1)                  TO  FRT-WS-PO.
      *    MOVE DE-RLSE (1)                TO  FRT-WS-RLSE.
      *    MOVE ZEROES                     TO  FRT-WS-RS-9.
      *    MOVE FRT-RLSE-RS                TO  FRT-PO-RCV-NO.
      *    IF REFERBACK-REFERBACK = SPACES
      *        MOVE PO-RLSE-RS             TO  FRT-REFERBACK
      *    ELSE
      *        MOVE REFERBACK-REFERBACK    TO  FRT-REFERBACK.
      *    MOVE DDAILYTC-DATE TO FRT-DATE-RCVD.
      *
      *    MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
      *    WRITE DPOFREIGHT-REC FROM BUF-DPOFREIGHT
      *        INVALID KEY MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
      *    IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
      *        MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
      *    IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
      *          MOVE "DBPUT3 DFREIGHT - SFREIGHT" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
      *          PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
