093500*                    B L O W U P                           *
093600*     CHECK FOR IMAGE, VIEW, OR SPOOL ERROR.  CLOSE        *
093700*     FILES, GET OUT OF BLOCK MODE, AND DISPLAY            *
093800*     APPROPRIATE ERROR MESSAGE ON SCREEN.                 *
093900*                                                          *
094000*     ALSO APPENDS THE ERROR MESSAGE TO A FILE CALLED      *
094100*     BLOWUP.PUB.  TO READ THIS FILE, RUN "XBLPRT.OBJECT". *
094200*                                                          *
094300*         |||  PROGRAM IS ABORTED IN TBLOWUP  |||          *
094400************************************************************
094500************************************************************
094600 990-BLOWUP.
094800     CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
094900           VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
095000           BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
095100 999-EXIT.  EXIT.
095200
095300 999-CATREAD.
           IF CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER = ZEROS
               MOVE LANG-SETNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE LANG-MSGNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM.
           CALL "CCATREAD" USING CATREAD-PARMS.
           MOVE CATREAD-MSG-TEXT TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.
096900 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
097000     EXIT.
